{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless build variety awaits!</strong> Mazing, gem merging, roguelike augments, and physics-driven combat collide to create chaotic defenses and wild synergies. <strong>Gem Miner TD\u00a0</strong>puts you in the role of a crafty miner tasked with creating deadly mazes, combining powerful gems, and surviving relentless waves. Every run feels fresh, unpredictable, and filled with dazzling chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/b5960ed8b687091b2ba4725e6947a600.poster.avif?t=1756390720\" width=516 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/b5960ed8b687091b2ba4725e6947a600.webm?t=1756390720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Maze\u00a0-</strong> Mine blocks to create intricate paths. Adjacent blocks become ore, transformable into powerful defensive gems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Defense -</strong>\u00a0Place gems to shoot down waves of enemies as they attempt to drag your miner to the lava pits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gem System -</strong> Combine gems of varying rarities to create increasingly powerful defenses \u2014 the more you combine, the mightier your defenses become.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Elements -</strong> After specific waves, choose from roguelike-style upgrades to customize your playstyle. Enhance your gems, empower your miner, or alter gameplay mechanics for a unique experience every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Challenges -</strong> Multiple maps, numerous miners, countless gem combinations, powerful augments, and varied enemy types make every playthrough feel fresh and exciting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maze...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/88558680005e85fca49446843384c829.poster.avif?t=1756390720\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/88558680005e85fca49446843384c829.webm?t=1756390720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/88558680005e85fca49446843384c829.mp4?t=1756390720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/471df72876d62024eda65940f2329f6d.poster.avif?t=1756390720\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/471df72876d62024eda65940f2329f6d.webm?t=1756390720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/471df72876d62024eda65940f2329f6d.mp4?t=1756390720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/b2e6eea0b54895f4be91956b7148f7a2.poster.avif?t=1756390720\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/b2e6eea0b54895f4be91956b7148f7a2.webm?t=1756390720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/b2e6eea0b54895f4be91956b7148f7a2.mp4?t=1756390720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful pixel graphics, deep strategy, and endless replayability await. Easy to play, hard to master! Are you ready to maze, combine and conquer? A tower defense where gem combinations and mazing lead to victory - wishlist now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/8be2588489e2386999c7dcef9f6e1b1e.poster.avif?t=1756390720\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/8be2588489e2386999c7dcef9f6e1b1e.webm?t=1756390720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Join our Discord server!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2835780?t=1756390720","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/fdfddf13f524ac4c3bfe6ddf22a5bfda39ee7d93/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756390720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/4ea916874558a2ca5a5b35c0bdf671fa7689d7ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756390720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/4ea916874558a2ca5a5b35c0bdf671fa7689d7ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756390720","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3775640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"b