80/ss_19b6d6354c3aeb6a7990846b592ae3b96f07ff87.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756390720","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/ss_19b6d6354c3aeb6a7990846b592ae3b96f07ff87.600x338.jpg?t=1756390720"}],"short_description":"Mine. Maze. Merge. Survive. Dig for powerful gems, merge them into game-breaking towers, and pick roguelike perks to build wild synergies in this vibrant 2D pixel art roguelike tower defense. Do not let enemies drag your miner to the lava!","steam_appid":2835780,"support_info":{"email":"support@iferalgames.com","url":"https://iferalgames.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://gemminertd.com/"}